{"input":{"title":"Unisex Christmas – We Said No Gifts Tee","handle":"unisex-christmas-we-said-no-gifts-graphic-tee","status":"DRAFT","vendor":"Graphic Tees Co.","productType":"T-Shirt","tags":["christmas","christmas-shirts","christmas-shirts-for-men","graphic-tees-for-men","graphic-tees-for-women","funny-christmas-shirts","funny-graphic-tees","retro-graphic-tees","ai-art","intake-done"],"descriptionHtml":"<h3>The Story</h3>\n<p>We said no gifts. We lied: a funny couples Christmas shirt for the pair who broke the deal again, each hiding a present from the other. Wear one yourself or put two in the cart for a matching pair (each tee is sold singly), and it is a good one among the Christmas gifts for couples that owns up to it.</p>\n<p>The print is a 1960s storybook scene in faded red, mustard, pine green and cream: a smiling husband in a cardigan and a wife in a sweater and pleated skirt stand back to back in front of a small decorated tree, each holding a big wrapped present with a ribbon bow on the side the other cannot see. WE SAID NO GIFTS. runs across the top in red slab capitals and We lied. sits below in black script.</p>\n<p>Wear it to the family party or Christmas Eve at home, alone or as a matching pair, or give it to the couple who swears every year that this one is a no-gift Christmas. Printed the day you order it.</p>\n<h3>Details &amp; Fit</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic unisex fit, crew neck</li>\n<li>100% combed, ring-spun cotton (heather colors contain polyester)</li>\n<li>Fabric weight: 4.2 oz/yd² — lightweight</li>\n<li>Pre-shrunk, side-seamed construction, shoulder-to-shoulder taping</li>\n<li>Sizes S–4XL</li>\n<li>Colors: White, Natural, Heather Dust, Athletic Heather, Ash, Tan</li>\n<li>Blank product sourced from Nicaragua, Honduras, or the US</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Questions</h3>\n<p><strong>What is the We Said No Gifts tee?</strong><br>It is a unisex Christmas graphic tee from Graphic Tees Co. with a 1960s husband and wife standing back to back, each hiding a wrapped present, lettered WE SAID NO GIFTS. We lied. It is printed on a Bella+Canvas 3001 in 4.2 oz cotton, so it stays light at a crowded family party.</p>\n<p><strong>How does the unisex tee fit him and her?</strong><br>This Graphic Tees Co. tee is a classic unisex cut in sizes S through 4XL with a crew neck and side-seamed body. He can order his usual size and she can size down for a closer fit or stay true for a classic one. The first size exchange is free.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I order a matching pair?</strong><br>Each Graphic Tees Co. tee is sold singly, so a pair means two in your cart, one in his size and one in hers, in the same color or two different ones. Orders over $45 ship free, and two tees at $24.99 each qualify for free US shipping.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I wash it so the print lasts?</strong><br>Wash your We Said No Gifts tee inside out in cold water and tumble dry low. It is 100% combed ring-spun cotton at 4.2 oz, with some polyester in the heather colors, and the red, mustard and green inks stay crisp through every Christmas party and wash.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I get it by Christmas?</strong><br>Order by about December 8 and your Graphic Tees Co. We Said No Gifts tee should arrive before Christmas. Each shirt is printed the day you order it, so ship times vary a little by location. The free size exchange within 30 days covers a wrong guess on size.</p>","seo":{"title":"Couples Christmas Shirt: We Said No Gifts Tee","description":"A funny couples Christmas shirt: we said no gifts, we lied. A 1960s pair hides presents. Unisex 4.2 oz cotton tee, S-4XL. Free size exchange."},"productOptions":[{"name":"Color","values":[{"name":"White"},{"name":"Natural"},{"name":"Heather Dust"},{"name":"Athletic Heather"},{"name":"Ash"},{"name":"Tan"}]},{"name":"Size","values":[{"name":"S"},{"name":"M"},{"name":"L"},{"name":"XL"},{"name":"2XL"},{"name":"3XL"},{"name":"4XL"}]}],"variants":[{"optionValues":[{"optionName":"Color","name":"White"},{"optionName":"Size","